s left parenthesis y minus 18 right parenthesis squared equals 81 k squared\"><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>81</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. Therefore, the equation that represents this circle is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis x minus 19 right parenthesis squared plus left parenthesis y minus 18 right parenthesis squared equals 81 k squared\"><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>81</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This equation represents a circle with radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"9 StartRoot k EndRoot\"><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"9 k\"><mn>9</mn><mi>k</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This equation represents a circle with radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartRoot 9 k EndRoot\"><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mi>k</mi></msqrt></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"9 k\"><mn>9</mn><mi>k</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This equation represents a circle with radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartRoot 9 EndRoot k\"><msqrt><mn>9</mn></msqrt><mi>k</mi></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"9 k\"><mn>9</mn><mi>k</mi></math>.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDat