at is the measure of angle <math alttext=\"upper P prime\"><msup><mi>P</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></math>?</p>","externalid":"e99677cc-b481-49aa-b1e3-816b48a49b59","templateid":"10c1808f-fdc4-4e36-9235-33917d50d783","vaultid":"e02c5747-9f85-4ac9-bcd6-b34f305d92e0","type":"mcq","answerOptions":[{"id":"59d0b6a4-9e89-4fba-8319-b4475852e8f8","content":"<p><math alttext=\"10 degree\"><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p>"},{"id":"6bfc1c5b-3ab1-44e8-9587-d2830c26b526","content":"<p><math alttext=\"30 degree\"><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p>"},{"id":"07a359d9-28ac-4c0f-a8cc-97a54169b0bc","content":"<p><math alttext=\"40 degree\"><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p>"},{"id":"c119d885-b197-43e8-9841-c7718cee780c","content":"<p><math alttext=\"90 degree\"><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p>"}],"correct_answer":["B"]},"createDate":1691007959838,"updateDate":1691007959838}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959838, 1691007959838),
