<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect. This is the sum of the measures of <math alttext="angle upper X"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>X</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math alttext="angle upper Y"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>Y</mi></math>, not the measure of&nbsp;<math alttext="angle upper Z"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>Z</mi></math>.</p>
