In the figure shown, line <math alttext=\"c\"><mi>c</mi>\n</math> intersects parallel lines <math alttext=\"s\"><mi>s</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>?</p>","externalid":"b09e0918-6dfc-4b50-b503-bbdd89fe3480","templateid":"e7ee23a5-d8d5-487a-81c8-c1c604124ecf","vaultid":"29301565-33b3-4f24-9430-2e14f3057510","type":"spr","answerOptions":[],"correct_answer":["70"]},"createDate":1691007959839,"updateDate":1691007959839}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959839, 1691007959839),
